</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I believe Thy precious blood,</l><l>Which, at the mercy seat of God,</l><l>Forever doth for sinners plead,</l><l>For me, e’en for my soul, was shed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, I believe were sinners more</l><l>Than sands upon the ocean shore,</l><l>Thou hast for all a ransom paid,</l><l>For all a full redemption made.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Bold can I stand in every way,</l><l>For who aught to my charge shall lay?</l><l>Fully, by Thee, absolved I am</l><l>From sin and fear, from guilt and shame.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>This spotless robe the same appears,</l><l>When ruined nature sinks in years;</l><l>No age can change its glorious hue,</l><l>Its glory is forever new.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Thou God of power, Thou God of love,</l><l>Let all Thy saints Thy mercy prove;</l><l>Our beauty this, our glorious dress,</l><l>Jesus the Lord, our Righteousness.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
